<title>USA: CBOT July soy lower on commission, local selling.</title>
<headline>CBOT July soy lower on commission, local selling.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Contrary to trade expectations, CBOT July soybeans opened lower in fast trading on commission house and local selling, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;Lind-Waldock offered 1.5 million (bushels) July right on the opening bell,&quot; a pit source said.</p>
</text>
